summary:
QuickBooks Introduces New Way to Shop Small with Holiday Gift Guide;
93% of Consumers Say Supporting Small Businesses this Holiday Season is Important

MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif., October 21, 2021--(BUSINESS WIRE)--New survey data released today from Intuit (Nasdaq: INTU) QuickBooks reveals that 93% of U.S. shoppers say supporting small businesses this upcoming holiday season is more important than ever because of the pandemic. Furthermore, nearly half of consumers (48%) are more likely to try new b
